  "The Garden Phantom leads a midnight parade \u2014 hedgehogs in a line! \u2014 and Milo is the lantern-bearer. And look what the Phantom found in the flowers: grandma's key! The End!": '69e8933bc52059d4.mp3',
  "The Scary Talent Show! Every monster did a big scare. Now it's Mo's turn. The gym goes silent... the curtain behind Mo ripples.": 'd9ae11f3a235cfff.mp3',
  "The Twins can't agree whose scare is best. They ask Mo to judge. Behind them, the trash can tiptoes away...": '982e68da7006c57a.mp3',
  "The animals weave Luna a crown of daisies \u2014 Hide-and-Seek Champion of the whole forest! The End!": '663f97004fd8fd2a.mp3',
  "The baby stars snuggle Luna like a sparkly blanket. Shhh... goodnight, Luna. The End!": '9b8dc547dd01dba5.mp3',
  "The cellar glows with a hundred little jam jars. A HUGE monster shadow rises on the wall! But look closer... it's a teeny-tiny mouse in a chef's hat, holding jam toast.": 'dee8c622c851e600.mp3',
  "The chest is full of golden biscuits! Best treasure a puppy ever found. The End!": '615b1f69dd720a19.mp3',
  "The crab door swings open \u2014 and there it is! A chest of golden bones and squeaky toys, deep in the sparkly cave. X marks the spot! The End!": '4daf1cbc9bdb09d2.mp3',
  "The fireflies lead Pip to a secret glowing garden \u2014 right where X marks the spot! Magic! The End!": 'b38a6f40d629872d.mp3',
  "The firefly boat sails to Star Island, where baby stars snore tiny sparkly snores. There's a soft moonbeam nest, and a little striped lighthouse. Where should Luna go?": 'e9b0ac783c1ef5c9.mp3',
  "The friendly cloud flies Luna all the way home, loop-de-loop! 'Same time tomorrow?' it whispers. The End!": 'a512991f83ffeee1.mp3',
  "The giant monster is... a tiny chef mouse and his candle! He offers Milo blackberry jam.": '3e5f68721bce1232.mp3',
  "The greenhouse plants sway... but there is no wind. And that tall white shape was NOT there before. It giggles a friendly little giggle. Could it be... a Garden Phantom?": 'e4a9bf58a8229276.mp3',
  "The hallway is dark and TOO quiet. Something is scratching inside the closet... it knows Milo is there.": 'e2d5c806a2549e53.mp3',
  "The jungle is buzzing and green! A rope ladder climbs a tall lookout palm, and a fat jungle vine swings over the gully. How should Pip go?": '4ac3317c2a67d928.mp3',
  "The map shows the park! Where should Pip look first?": '4f4e4d2133b54604.mp3',
  "The sandcastle is magnificent, and a little crab wants to be its king!": 'ea86d3406332d6b2.mp3',
  "The sound was three tiny kittens, peeking out of an old watering can! 'Mew! Mew! We're hungry and a little lost.'": '8158a5c38fe4557a.mp3',
  "The stream opens into a secret glowing lagoon! A tiny lighthouse blinks hello \u2014 there's a crab waving! And over there, a geyser burps giant rainbow bubbles. Where to?": '78ae1b13605dac39.mp3',
  "The sun is setting at the old oak. Inside lives a family of glowing fireflies! They swirl around Pip.": '787d5b6b57894a69.mp3',
  "The swing carries Luna to a balcony on the moon! A big brass telescope peeks at the stars, and a curly silver slide swooshes all the way home. What should Luna pick?": '2af1b7b784c651f9.mp3',
  "The whale shows Luna a glowing pearl \u2014 a gift for her bravery! The End!": 'cfc4a958560d16c1.mp3',
  "The whisperers are owls! It's their midnight book club. 'Shhh,' says the owl, smiling.": '7373f75d917cf94f.mp3',
